{"id":"n14389-1-7","stage":2,"title":"도마 · 砧板","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14389-1-7-1","ko":"다져야 하는 야채들은 어디에 놓을까요?","zh":"需要切碎的蔬菜要放在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다져야","meaning":"剁","explanation":"다지다：剁；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"다지다","audio":"/audio/3e49224795eea6ede5ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40591","senseId":"1","lemma":"다지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다져야","audio":"/audio/8b20e9a74479d91b0e26.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"야채들은","meaning":"蔬菜","explanation":"야채：蔬菜；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"야채","audio":"/audio/36d7e2795dabf3c6d89a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90066","senseId":"1","lemma":"야채","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야채들은","audio":"/audio/b97f8a80847f187030ee.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓을까요","audio":"/audio/62b21ced431faf6c824a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3e49224795eea6ed","term":"다지다","zh":"剁","audio":"/audio/3e49224795eea6ede5ef.mp3","entryId":"40591","definition":"多次用刀把肉或蔬菜切成小块。","pronunciation":["다지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"36d7e2795dabf3c6","term":"야채","zh":"蔬菜","audio":"/audio/36d7e2795dabf3c6d89a.mp3","entryId":"90066","definition":"在田里种植，主要以叶子、茎干或果实供使用的农作物。","pronunciation":["야ː채"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a4e3a4fdb229380d3937.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14389-1-7-2","ko":"도마 위에 올려 놓으렴.","zh":"把它们放在砧板上吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도마","meaning":"砧板，菜板","explanation":"도마：砧板，菜板","readings":[{"term":"도마","audio":"/audio/5f25cdce1eda97f9372b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14389","senseId":"1","lemma":"도마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도마","audio":"/audio/5f25cdce1eda97f9372b.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"올려","meaning":"放，抬","explanation":"올리다：放，抬；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22109","senseId":"4","lemma":"올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올려","audio":"/audio/7451fed596c0e318c0ce.mp3"}},{"text":"놓으렴.","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}